# My HTML Portfolio

## 📌 Project Overview
This project is a personal portfolio website created using HTML. It showcases my personal information, skills, projects, and contact details through multiple web pages.

## ✨ Features
- Home page
- About Me section
- Skills page
- Projects page
- Contact page
- Navigation between all pages

## 🛠 Technologies Used
- HTML

